{"text":"I readily engaged with that opening, thrilled to be among the world's best minds, yet overwhelmed by the reality of being a part of the world's most prestigious institution of learning. As a result, I did things that I should have done, like studying hard, going to the stacks, to do the research for my papers and better knowledge of the history of my country. I'm glad there's so many people in here that are like me, know what the stacks were. Those were those isolated things that contained books, which people used to read and others used to write before Google's color was created. I also did things I should not have done.","words":[{"text":"I","start":0.0,"end":0.94},{"text":"readily","start":0.94,"end":1.28},{"text":"engaged","start":1.28,"end":2.04},{"text":"with","start":2.04,"end":2.92},{"text":"that","start":2.92,"end":3.1},{"text":"opening","start":3.1,"end":3.58,"punct":","},{"text":"thrilled","start":4.62,"end":5.0},{"text":"to","start":5.0,"end":5.62},{"text":"be","start":5.62,"end":5.78},{"text":"among","start":5.78,"end":6.02},{"text":"the","start":6.02,"end":6.2},{"text":"world's","start":6.2,"end":6.64},{"text":"best","start":6.64,"end":6.9},{"text":"minds","start":6.9,"end":7.56,"punct":","},{"text":"yet","start":8.36,"end":8.64},{"text":"overwhelmed","start":8.64,"end":9.22},{"text":"by","start":9.22,"end":10.6},{"text":"the","start":10.6,"end":10.72},{"text":"reality","start":10.72,"end":11.08},{"text":"of","start":11.08,"end":11.44},{"text":"being","start":11.44,"end":11.66},{"text":"a","start":11.66,"end":11.84},{"text":"part","start":11.84,"end":12.06},{"text":"of","start":12.06,"end":12.22},{"text":"the","start":12.22,"end":12.36},{"text":"world's","start":12.36,"end":12.82},{"text":"most","start":12.82,"end":13.08},{"text":"prestigious","start":13.08,"end":13.66},{"text":"institution","start":13.66,"end":14.28},{"text":"of","start":14.28,"end":14.6},{"text":"learning","start":14.6,"end":14.92,"punct":"."},{"text":"As","start":16.32,"end